        "claimInstanced(uint256,address,address)": {
          "details": "Claims the launch phase bonus for a HEX stake instance (HSI). It also injects      the HSI share data into into the shareList. This is a privileged  operation       only HEXStakeInstanceManager.sol can call.",
          "params": {
